              },
              "children": [
                {
                  "id": "lede",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you run a trucking business, every hour your truck is off the road affects your bottom line.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full",
                    "anchor": "post-lede"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "That's why choosing the right semi truck service centers is one of the most important decisions you'll make, especially here in Florida, where long hauls, heat, and demanding routes can accelerate wear and tear. At Sun State International, we understand how crucial reliable maintenance is for your fleet's safety, performance, and uptime. Our service centers are built around one goal: to keep your business moving without delay.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-intro-2",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "We'll break down why reliable service matters, what sets a high-quality commercial truck service center apart, and why Florida drivers trust Sun State International for dependable, professional support.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-importance",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "The Importance of Dependable Semi Truck Service Centers in Florida",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "importance"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-importance-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Florida roads are tough on equipment. Between long highways like I-75, congested city routes, and stop-and-go port traffic, trucks experience more stress than many operators expect. That's why consistent care from a trustworthy semi truck service center isn't optional; it's business survival. A dependable center helps you:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "checks-importance-2",
                  "type": "check-list",
                  "props": {
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Extend the life of your fleet"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Prevent breakdowns"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Improve fuel efficiency"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Reduce unexpected repair costs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Protect driver safety"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Maintain DOT compliance"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h-what-sets-apart",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "What Sets a High-Quality Commercial Truck Service Center Apart?",
                    "headingLevel": 2,
                    "align": "left",
                    "anchor": "what-sets-apart"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-sets-apart-1",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Not all service centers are the same, and for trucking companies, choosing the wrong repair shop can cost thousands in lost revenue. Here's what distinguishes a trusted commercial truck service center:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-what-sets-apart-2",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "1. Certified Truck Technicians Who Know Your Equipment",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-sets-apart-3",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Your truck is a major investment. It deserves to be serviced by technicians who are trained, certified, and up-to-date on International® standards. At Sun State International, our technicians undergo continuous Navistar training to ensure they're prepared for anything: engine diagnostics, after treatment, electrical systems, and more.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-what-sets-apart-4",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "2. Fast, Straightforward Service",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-sets-apart-5",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "When you search for a truck repair shop, you're not looking for bells and whistles; you want answers, accuracy, and a quick turnaround. Sun State International focuses on streamlined processes, upfront communication, and realistic expectations so you never feel left in the dark.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "h3-what-sets-apart-6",
                  "type": "heading",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "3. Full Capability for All Semi Truck Service Florida Needs",
                    "headingLevel": 3,
                    "align": "left"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-sets-apart-7",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "From maintenance to major repairs, a reliable center should handle it all. Sun State International provides:",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "list-what-sets-apart-8",
                  "type": "prose-list",
                  "props": {
                    "ordered": false,
                    "items": [
                      {
                        "text": "Full-service PMs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Brake and suspension repairs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "DOT inspections"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Diagnostic testing"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "A/C, electrical, and emissions service"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Warranty repairs"
                      },
                      {
                        "text": "Engine and transmission work"
                      }
                    ]
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "p-what-sets-apart-9",
                  "type": "text",
                  "props": {
                    "text": "Plus, with extensive parts availability, downtime stays low, and productivity stays high.",
                    "align": "left",
                    "width": "full"
                  }
                },
                {
                  "id": "fig-1",
                  "type": "image",
                  "props": {
                    "width": "full",
